<%- include('../partials/layout-start') %>

<%- include('../partials/page-header', {
  icon: 'bi-credit-card',
  heading: 'Pricing',
  sub: 'Two paid things. Everything else on the Hub is free.'
}) %>

<section class="glass-section pb-5">
<div class="container">
  <%- include('../partials/flash') %>

  <% if (!stripeReady) { %>
    <div class="alert alert-info">
      <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>
      Card payments are not switched on for this deployment yet. Everything below is still
      available — <a href="/contact">ask us</a> and we will invoice you directly.
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <div class="glass-card h-100">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="icon-tile icon-amber mb-3"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i></span>
          <h2 class="h4">Featured job placement</h2>
          <p class="invoice-total mb-1"><%= formatMinor(jobFeaturePrice) %></p>
          <p class="text-muted-2 small">per job, per <%= jobFeatureDays %> days</p>
          <p>
            Your role sits at the top of the board and carries a Featured label, in whatever
            order the reader has chosen to sort by. Buying again while a window is open
            extends it rather than replacing it.
          </p>
          <p class="small text-muted-2 mb-0">
            Bought from the job itself: open a job you have published and choose
            <strong>Feature this job</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <div class="glass-card h-100">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="icon-tile icon-blue mb-3"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text"></i></span>
          <h2 class="h4">Project deposit</h2>
          <p class="invoice-total mb-1"><%= depositPercent %>%</p>
          <p class="text-muted-2 small">of an accepted quote, <%= formatMinor(depositMin) %> minimum, <%= formatMinor(depositMax) %> maximum</p>
          <p>
            Take a deposit against a scope estimate your client has accepted. The amount comes
            from the quote's own stored total — the figure that was actually presented — not
            from today's catalogue, so a quote priced last quarter takes last quarter's deposit.
          </p>
          <p class="small text-muted-2 mb-0">
            The cap exists because a deposit on a very large programme is above what a card will
            authorise; the balance is invoiced off-platform.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="glass-card mt-4">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h2 class="h5">What we do not charge for</h2>
      <p class="mb-0 text-muted-2">
        Posting a job, applying for one, the rate index, the scope estimator, messaging and the
        community are free and stay free. A marketplace that charges to be seen ends up ranking
        by budget, and the rate index only means anything while everybody is still in it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/layout-end') %>
